-- title:
--   Original intrinsic finite predictable-grid L2 isometry with all integrability discharged
-- statement:
--   For original intrinsic finite negative-band NX counts, finite original measure P, L2 centred counts and essentially bounded predictable coefficients, all finite-grid integrability and cross-term hypotheses are automatic. The isometry is proved assuming exact source original conditional count variance and prefix adaptedness, and no synthetic Poisson process.
-- source:
